Unlock the door:

As a user of the CoolManager system,
I want to have the ability to unlock the refrigerator door,
So that I can access the refrigerator's interior when needed, even if the door is locked for any reason.
Additionally, I expect the CoolManager system to provide a simple and intuitive method for unlocking the door,
And I anticipate receiving visual or audible cues to confirm that the door has been successfully unlocked and is ready for access.

If the door is locked for any reason, the user should be able to unlock it to access the refrigerator's interior.
